---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | Md. Farhatul Abrar"
  description="Md. Farhatul Abrar, Lecturer in Chemical Engineering at BUET, works on hydrothermal conversion and life-cycle assessment, with a growing interest in molecular simulation and reaction kinetics."
>
  <main class="page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p class="bio">
      I am a Lecturer in Chemical Engineering at Bangladesh University of
      Engineering and Technology (BUET). My research has focused on
      hydrothermal carbonization (HTC) of waste and biomass, combining
      experiments, statistical optimization, and life cycle assessment to
      compare conversion pathways for waste-derived feedstocks. That work
      raised a question I now want to answer more directly: why a process
      performs the way it does. I am building skills in reactive molecular
      dynamics (LAMMPS/ReaxFF) to study the chemistry of hydrothermal
      conversion, with the aim of linking reaction mechanisms and kinetics
      to process-scale modeling and decision-making for sustainable
      chemical and energy systems.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ul class="entry-list">
        <li>
          <div class="entry-row">
            <span class="entry-title">M.Sc. in Chemical Engineering</span>
            <span class="entry-date">January 2025</span>
          </div>
          <span class="entry-meta"
            >Bangladesh University of Engineering and Technology (BUET)</span
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="entry-row">
            <span class="entry-title">B.Sc. in Chemical Engineering</span>
            <span class="entry-date">May 2023</span>
          </div>
          <span class="entry-meta"
            >Bangladesh University of Engineering and Technology (BUET)</span
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Academic Experience</h2>
      <ul class="entry-list">
        <li>
          <div class="entry-row">
            <span class="entry-title">Lecturer</span>
            <span class="entry-date">April 2025 – Present</span>
          </div>
          <span class="entry-meta"
            >Department of Chemical Engineering, BUET</span
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="entry-row">
            <span class="entry-title">Research Assistant</span>
            <span class="entry-date">July 2023 – December 2024</span>
          </div>
          <span class="entry-meta"
            >Department of Chemical Engineering, BUET</span
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    .page {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 24px 120px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-head);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 32px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .bio {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0 0 56px;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 44px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-head);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .entry-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .entry-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .entry-title {
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .entry-date {
      font-family: var(--font-head);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .entry-meta {
      display: block;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>